[[File:Same Fate (Beta 34.0).png|thumb|293x293px|Beta 34.0]]
Same Fate only gained nerfs over its lifetime. Starting at 4G, it gained +1G every time. The first time was in '''Beta 2.0''', followed by '''Beta 4.1''', then in '''Beta 11.0 '''and finally in''' Beta 34.0'''.

It wasn't until '''Beta 41.0'''* where things changed, starting with its effect. Instead of setting the CURRENT HP of all monsters to 1, it now sets their MAX HP to 1 (which also sets their current HP to 1 by default), no longer setting them in a damaged state. '''Beta 43.1''' followed this with a simple cost drop back of -1G.

''*This is only a guess, as it wasn't clearly stated anywhere, and was most likely a result of the Card Engine Rework at that time (with the introduction of Aura effects).''
